{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Zombies &amp; Bullets</strong> is a <strong>3D</strong> <strong>top-down action shooter</strong> game where you must help the soldier <strong>Jacob</strong> face armies of <strong>zombies</strong> in varied scenarios full of <strong>challenges</strong>. Prove your <strong>skills</strong> and <strong>reflexes</strong> and become the warrior of the zombie apocalypse!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Skills</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can improve your <strong>skills</strong> in <strong>camps</strong> as you gain <strong>experience levels</strong>. You can also collect <strong>backpacks</strong> that grant <strong>unique abilities</strong> while <strong>equipped</strong>. Adapt Jacob to your <strong>play style</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2802870/extras/ce1fbb5f76c2836aed6322955ad8de6a.poster.avif?t=1760372890\" width=1024 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2802870/extras/ce1fbb5f76c2836aed6322955ad8de6a.webm?t=1760372890\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2802870/extras/ce1fbb5f76c2836aed6322955ad8de6a.mp4?t=1760372890\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Weapons</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game features a variety of <strong>weapons</strong> like a shotgun, submachine gun, grenade launcher, flamethrower, electric cannon, grenades, etc. Explore the <strong>possibilities</strong> for every situation!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2802870/extras/0718ffaa610e3e273de7e402db4df195.poster.avif?t=1760372890\" width=1024 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2802870/extras/0718ffaa610e3e273de7e402db4df195.webm?t=1760372890\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2802870/extras/0718ffaa610e3e273de7e402db4df195.mp4?t=1760372890\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Enemies</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will come face-to-face with <strong>hordes of enemies</strong> that will corner you, forcing you to <strong>defeat them all</strong> to keep advancing. Use different <strong>strategies</strong> for different <strong>enemies</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2802870/extras/2a8db00b86203f7643ffb9776e577f98.poster.avif?t=1760372890\" width=1024 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2802870/extras/2a8db00b86203f7643ffb9776e577f98.webm?t=1760372890\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2802870/extras/2a8db00b86203f7643ffb9776e577f98.mp4?t=1760372890\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Scenarios and Levels</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore scenarios</strong> like the grove, abandoned mine, forest, ancient ruins, etc. Each scenario is <strong>divided</strong> into several <strong>levels</strong> with diverse <strong>challenges</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2802870/extras/8bc520392183120793d888727d73be5e.poster.avif?t=1760372890\" width=1024 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2802870/extras/8bc520392183120793d888727d73be5e.webm?t=1760372890\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2802870/extras/8bc520392183120793d888727d73be5e.mp4?t=1760372890\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Bosses</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The <strong>bosses</strong> will make you prove your <strong>skills</strong> and <strong>reflexes</strong>, forcing you to use your entire arsenal of <strong>weapons</strong> and <strong>movements</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2802870/extras/4f01d006045ac344ae0d0ab1f52f8d84.poster.avif?t=1760372890\" width=1024 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2802870/extras/4f01d006045ac344ae0d0ab1f52f8d84.webm?t=1760372890\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2802870/extras/4f01d006045ac344ae0d0ab1f52f8d84.mp4?t=1760372890\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Notes on the demo:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The first scenario is available to play, including the first boss</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The pistol, shotgun, and submachine gun are available to be equipped</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4 backpacks with unique abilities are available to be equipped</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2802870?t=1760372890","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2802870/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1760372890","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2802870/72562adbdcfa4e172590743e6ad380baa9016a82/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1760372890","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2802870/72562adbdcfa4e172590743e6ad380baa9016a82/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1760372890","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Stats","id":15},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"This game contains stylized violence with blood, decapitations, dismemberment, deaths caused by firearms, explosions, electrocution, and incineration, applied exclusively to zombie enemies. The level of blood and dismemberment can be reduced or disabled in the options menu."},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":3523830,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Zombies &amp; Bullets</strong> is a <strong>3D</strong> <strong>top-down action shooter</strong> game where you must help the soldier <strong>Jacob</strong> face armies of <strong>zombies</strong> in varied scenarios full of <strong>challenges</strong>. Prove your <strong>skills</strong> and <strong>reflexes</strong> and become the warrior of the zombie apocalypse!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Skills</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can improve your <strong>skills</strong> in <strong>camps</strong> as you gain <strong>experience levels</strong>. You can also collect <strong>backpacks</strong> that grant <strong>unique abilities</strong> while <strong>equipped</strong>. Adapt Jacob to your <strong>play style</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamst